### VOICEVOX — a separate program, not bundled

daw_01 talks to a **separately installed** VOICEVOX ENGINE over HTTP
(http://localhost:50021) and may launch its executable as a child process.  No
VOICEVOX code, voice model, dictionary or character voice is contained in, or
distributed with, this repository.  VOICEVOX and its characters have their own
terms of use, which apply to any audio you generate with them:

  VOICEVOX          https://voicevox.hiroshiba.jp/
  Terms of use      https://voicevox.hiroshiba.jp/term/
  VOICEVOX ENGINE   https://github.com/VOICEVOX/voicevox_engine


### Rust crate dependencies

398 crates are linked into the three executables.  Their names, versions,
licenses and upstream URLs are listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, which is
generated from `cargo metadata` by `scripts/dep_licenses.py`.  Every one of them
is under a licence compatible with GPL-3.0-or-later; `make license-check`
enforces that on every run.


### Audio plug-ins loaded at run time

daw_01 loads CLAP and VST 3 plug-ins that the user has installed.  Those
plug-ins are separate programs, are not distributed with daw_01, and keep their
own licences.
